  m_text: '<b>Valletta: Streets of History.</b>


    The <u>team</u> consisted of:

    Aphrodite
    Andreou

    Krista Bonello Rutter Giappone

    Ioannis Brellas

    Lara Caruana
    Montaldo

    Emmanuela Marla

    Renata Ntelia

    Daniel Vella

    Naomi
    Cutajar


    <u>The team would like to thank</u>:


    Arts Council Malta;
    Judge Emeritus Dr Giovanni Bonello

    Dr Joan Abela (Notarial Archives; Department
    of History)

    Mr Noel D''Anastas (National Archives)

    Mr Louis Cini (Bibliotheca)

    Mr
    Vince Peresso, the Santo Spirito staff, Ms Chanelle Briffa (Notarial Archives)

    Dr
    Sarah Azzopardi-Ljubibratic (Tayar Foundation for Jewish Heritage in Malta)

    Mr
    Gabriel Farrugia (Mdina Metropolitan Archives)

    Dr Evelyn Pullicino (Diocesan
    Archives)

    Professor Yosanne Vella (Faculty of Education).

    Aline P''Nina
    Tayar.


    Sound effects:

    https://pixabay.com/sound-effects/search/theme/nature/

    https://mixkit.co/free-sound-effects/nature/?page=2'
